<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,587 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,587 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,587 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,581 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 28		  Oct 25</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,587		   3,581</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.40		    0.80</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
